    "Content": "<p>Manage your cloud spending with confidence by using forecasted cost alerts. Now generally available, with the Azure Cost Management and&nbsp;Billing you can prevent cost overruns with Azure budget&nbsp;alerts on forecasted costs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/prevent-exceeding-azure-budget-with-forecasted-cost-alerts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Manage your cloud spending with confidence by using forecasted cost alerts. Now generally available, with the Azure Cost Management and Billing you can prevent cost overruns with Azure budget alerts on forecasted costs.\n\nLearn more ."
